abstract: >-
  Analysis code and derived data for a methodological study showing that the
  differentially regulated gene set produced by single-cell virtual knockout is
  contained in the knocked-out gene's direct out-neighbours. The containment
  rule was verified in 44 networks and approximately 25,600 knockouts spanning
  human and mouse, five tissues and network sizes of 800-9,970 genes, including
  26 cell-subsample replicates of the two primary networks that were used to
  assess stability. The behaviour is specific to scTenifoldKnk and does not
  hold for CellOracle.
